          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Elkanah went home to Ramah. And the boy ministered to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", in the presence of Eli the priest.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now the sons of Eli were worthless men; they had no regard for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The custom of the priests with the people was that when any man offered sacrifice, the priest's servant would come, while the meat was boiling, with a three-pronged fork in his hand, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he would thrust it into the pan, or kettle, or caldron, or pot; all that the fork brought up the priest would take for himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "with it",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " So they did at Shiloh to all the Israelites who came there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover, before the fat was burned, the priest's servant would come and say to the man who was sacrificing, “Give meat for the priest to roast; for he will not accept boiled meat from you, but raw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if the man said to him, “Let them burn the fat first, and then take as much as you wish,” he would say, “No, you must give it now; and if not, I will take it by force.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus the sin of the young men was very great in the sight of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for the men treated the offering of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with contempt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel was ministering before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", a boy girded with a linen ephod. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And his mother used to make for him a little robe and take it to him each year, when she went up with her husband to offer the yearly sacrifice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Eli would bless Elkanah and his wife, and say, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " give you children by this woman for the loan which she lent to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for the petition which she asked of",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "”; so then they would return to their home.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
